OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel to be stood down in
OL,4,Acoming months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lakeside hotel which houses asylum
OL,7,Fseekers will no longer be used for
OL,8,Faccommodation, city's MPs have
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FThe Dragonfly Hotel, in Thorpe Meadows,
OL,12,FPeterborough, has housed up to 146
OL,13,Fasylum seekers since November 2024.
OL,15,FPeterborough's Labour MPs, Sam Carling
OL,16,Fand Andrew Pakes, welcomed the
OL,17,Fgovernment decision, having previously
OL,18,Fargued the site was "unsuitable" for
OL,19,Fsuch accommodation.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
