OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel to be stood down in
OL,4,Acoming months
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn exact date for the hotel's closure
OL,7,Fhas not yet been given but the process
OL,8,Fof ending its use has now begun. The
OL,9,Fcurrent occupants are expected to move
OL,10,Fout over the coming months, Pakes and
OL,11,FCarling said in a joint statement.
